[36m(TaskRunner pid=6898)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6898)[0m Following this is a line with exactly N integers p1, p2, ..., pN (1 ≤ pi ≤ 106). The price of one share of stock on the i-th day is given by pi.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6898)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6898)[0m Output
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6898)[0m 
